{"id":"vod_zy360_73473","vodId":"73473","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"乡下大叔成为剑圣","name_cn":"乡下大叔成为剑圣","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250622-1/f6215b435bc582b03613b37e6f4ec792.jpg"},"summary":"贝利尔·加德南特，只不过是一位在乡下经营剑术道场的中年人。朝着剑士顶点而努力的日子已经是遥远的过去，正在他接受了自身的实力，悠哉度日时，曾经是他徒弟，现如今已飞黄腾达当上了王国骑士团长的艾露西亚·西特拉斯时隔多年来拜访他。“我推荐老师您担任骑士团专属特别教官，成功获得了批准。”就这样，平静的乡下生活结束，对此没有半点所谓的贝利尔·加德南特，他的命运将发生巨大改变——！在都市的生活。与大幅成长的弟子们的再会。与新的伙伴、以及强敌相遇。“对我这样过了巅峰期的大叔来说，担子太沉重了啊……”如是感受的贝利尔，长年脚踏实地锻炼出来的剑技将会达到被称为“乡下剑圣”的恐怖程度——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-08-11 22:25:01","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250420/nCp4xoCU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250811/8A8bPLDq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250420/YL7hIYz6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250427/pFwHEUxk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/SkVXOTWy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250511/9SCUO7jY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250519/TeO309vi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250525/gp34WiGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250601/wUfyJIop/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250609/u6SQu1Gp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250622/HUpIfV8P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250622/HhmJVjOB/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:18.304Z"}